GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4114100,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4114100","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:45Z","value":23,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4475210","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1845383656383768","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"PLAY INKBLOOD DEMO NOW","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors! We’ve all been waiting for this. Your carriage awaits! Inkblood demo is already available for everyone to play. With all the feedback from the playtest, we can finally show you what we got. The engine is inserted, fuel pumped and the door is sealed. The time has come, get to the bottom of this. Your predecessor’s fate relies on it. Time to meet the cult face to face. Even if you played the playtest before, there are new things to check out. First three cases - the tutoria","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T19:30:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1836506165570861","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"We Won Another Award!","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors! Just a small piece of news to share and celebrate while we’re hard at work on the game. We won another award! (The previous one was Socky for best booth on PAX, for those of you wondering) In TooManyGames 2026 Indie Game Showcase Award we won the “Best Puzzle Game” category. And you bet we’re pretty happy about it. Inquisition sure is pleased! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45882316/28a055ae3c4db5d2c9489472f9798b3272ba8633.jpg It’s amazing to see so much support (dare we say hype) fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T15:35:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570861","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1835871199312936","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"Wait... 60,000 of you?!","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors!Inkblood has passed 60,000 wishlists on Steam.We genuinely didn't expect to hit this number so fast, and it's all thanks to you spreading the word, sharing the game, and dragging your friends into the mystery with you.Thank you for every wishlist, every playtest response, every kind message, and every theory about what’s really going on in there. Thank you for helping us get this far.Stay weird! Hey Bird and CRITICAL REFLEX","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T13:15:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199312936","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1832700592792637","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"Inkblood Playtest Ended","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors! The carriage is sealed shut for now! Inkblood Playtest has ended. If you missed it – fret not, we plan to have a demo in the future, available for everyone! By the way, the open playtest went great! We got more than 2000 responses in our feedback form (which you should fill in if you played the game and forgot, *wink-wink*) – and the majority of your feedback is extremely positive. We’re definitely glad to hear that, thank you for your support! This really helps to get pe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T16:44:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592792637","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1832700592789346","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Ends in 24 Hours!","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors! Hope you caught all the perpetrators you could. A quick heads-up! We plan to close access to Inkblood Playtest tomorrow, in 24 hours from now. So, if you didn’t have the chance to try the game – now’s the time. You should have enough time to try everything and even send your feedback! To join, hit the “Request Access” button on Inkblood’s store page, you’ll get in immediately. https://store.steampowered.com/app/4114100/Inkblood/ {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45882316/b85e3825fcaef40","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T15:00:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592789346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1831432155564941","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Diary #1 is Out!","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors! Hope you're enjoying the playtest so far! We certainly do. Meanwhile we've been preparing a little something for the most eager of you - we've released our very first devlog! To kick things off, in this one we talk about the game's premise: what is your goal, your tools for the investigation, what to expect after the playtest... and why you aren't leaving your carriage any time soon. Inquisition wants to know what you think about this format! So expect our eyes carefully ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T12:13:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155564941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1830797770234156","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"OPEN PLAYTEST STARTS NOW","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors! You’ve been waiting for it, and we’ve been too! The playtest has started already, if you signed up earlier – check your library, Inkblood Playtest should already be there. If you haven’t – we still got you covered! Head to Inkblood’s Steam page and press the “Request Access” button, you’ll get in immediately. https://store.steampowered.com/app/4114100/Inkblood/ Just as a reminder, here’s what’s waiting for you: Free-form investigation – you’re given all the info, work wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-23T20:10:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770234156","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1829528821310284","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"Sign Up for Inkblood Playtest!","summary":"Greetings, Inquisitors! We know you all are eager to get to your duties. Victims demand justice and cultists tremble anticipating their punishment. And we’re happy to let you prove yourself. Soon, on April 23rd we plan to hold a playtest for Inkblood. You’ll get a taste for detective work, familiarize yourself with your carriage and its many secrets, make your first steps at uncovering the grand conspiracy and capture some perpetrators mid-act. What’s in it for you? Free-form investigation – you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-10T14:09:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821310284","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1818752592127898","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"Agatha’s Request","summary":"Oh hello there! Pleasure to meetcha! I’m Agatha. Look, I’m in a bit of a hurry, so I’ll be brief. I’ve been looking at the sky (as I always do, don’t look at me like that). And there was a peculiar thing! You know falling stars right? A wound on the sky that heals in seconds? I’ve seen one recently, but it wasn’t like the others. A second scar formed in its own direction. A part broke off! And fell here somewhere, on the earth! Don’t even think it, it’s mine, I saw it first. I want my very own s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-12T15:11:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592127898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4114100-1818118366174515","game_id":"steam-4114100","kind":"announcement","title":"Presenting Inkblood!","summary":"Coming straight to you from PC Gaming Show… What lurks deep in these woods and valleys? Inquisitor #0134! Strange happenings were reported from Inqburg. Someone (or something) places unknown marks, brutally murders locals, and leaves sites of blasphemous rituals behind. The Inquisition suspects a new cult is at play. Your predecessor has disappeared under mysterious circumstances, and this task is your responsibility now. Do not fail us like he did. A piece of advice for this investigation: Sear","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-04T22:01:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366174515","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4114100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4114100":"2026-10-26T01:45:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4114100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4475210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:45:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4114100","app_id":4114100,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:28Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fdedc67415a6e1be400bdd0763500b409e45c397db291197c4589a62c73e6769","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"당신은 죽음의 흔적을 쫓는 심문관입니다. 광신도들이 판을 치는 마당에, 당신의 전임자는 자취를 감췄으며, 지역 전체는 혼돈의 벼랑 끝에 내몰려 있습니다. 진실을 밝혀내십시오. 이단심문소의 권위를 지켜내십시오. 결코 실패해서는 안 됩니다.","publishers":[{"name":"CRITICAL REFLEX","creator_clan_account_id":40619234}],"developers":[{"name":"Hey Bird!","creator_clan_account_id":45866251}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1830240000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_year"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"CR Time Teaser","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792660764","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4114100/1335813519/96b5936c341f5f1f6412814cd8b281346ddc51b3/1792660538/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4114100/1335813519/96b5936c341f5f1f6412814cd8b281346ddc51b3/1792660538/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4114100/1335813519/96b5936c341f5f1f6412814cd8b281346ddc51b3/1792660538/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4114100/1335813519/96b5936c341f5f1f6412814cd8b281346ddc51b3/1792660538/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"411410